OL,5,G2255 Taggart
OL,6,     FA delivery van is hijacked and its
OL,7,     Fcontents stolen. But there's more
OL,8,     Fgoing on than meets the eye, and
OL,9,     Fsomeone's killing anyone who knows
OL,10,     Fabout the hijack...
OL,11,G0100 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FRoz shoots Antonia McNally on the
OL,13,     Fsteps of the courthouse. In
OL,14,     FWentworth, Martha goes after Roz,
OL,15,     Fbut Bea intercedes and gets
OL,16,     Fanother spell in solitary.
OL,17,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,18,     FThe officers challenge Fletcher's
OL,19,     Fnew policies, Karen visits Mum's
OL,20,     Fdaughter, and the Salvation Army
OL,21,     Fhas reported that Doreen's mother
OL,22,     Fhas been trying to find her...
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
